From 03947f556a69d87736e80db9940083dae11388b5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jason Keyrouz <jason@example.invalid>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:45:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Undo deploy (code and data) with a safety backup before
 every deploy, and a recovery scorecard

- deploy-app.sh backs up the data before a new version replaces a running app (trigger pre-deploy) and
  records it on the Deployment; no release if that backup fails
- Undo code and data: restore the safety backup into a new database, pause the app, back up the current
  data (pre-undo), swap the databases by rename (old one kept), release the previous version, check it
- Undo code only reuses redeploy
- Recovery scorecard on each app: data you could lose, measured time to recover, last recovery test
- Progress step boxes wrap to readable columns in narrow dialogs
